{"count": 1, "last_evaluated_key_id": null, "last_sort": null, "tiles": [{"acf": {"components": [{"acf_fc_layout": "hero", "hero": {"headline_text": "Kids and Teens Training Plans ", "subheadline_text": "With up to 56 days (8 weeks) of programming, these programs for kids and teens are perfect for after school classes or summer and winter breaks. "}}, {"acf_fc_layout": "text_block", "text_block": {"body_text": "<div style=\"background-color: #ffffff; border-left: 4px solid #111111; padding: 18px; margin: 24px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0; font-family: sans-serif;\">\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 4px; font-weight: bold; color: #111111; font-size: 16px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">UPDATE: KIDS &amp; TEENS With Equipment TRACKS EXPANDED</p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #666666; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 500;\">Released: May 19, 2026</p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; color: #444444; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5;\">The <em>Kids with Equipment</em> and <em>Teens with Equipment</em> tracks have been expanded from 4 weeks to 8 weeks! Use the links below to jump straight to the new block of programming.</p>\n<div style=\"font-size: 14px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;\">\n<div><a style=\"color: #0056b3; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://affiliate.crossfit.com/tools/programming/kids/kids-with-equipment/daily-class-plan/day-29\">Week 5, Day 1 of Kids with Equipment →</a></div>\n<div><a style=\"color: #0056b3; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://affiliate.crossfit.com/tools/programming/kids/teens-with-equipment/daily-class-plan/day-29\">Week 5, Day 1 of Teens with Equipment →</a></div>\n<div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n"}}, {"acf_fc_layout": "curated_content_list", "curated_content_list": {"content_items": [{"body_text": "[workout text removed: CAP content is published by CrossFit]", "content_type": "internal_link", "he